UID:ca4a81f2b94402dcca0f1cfa0bc0b85c@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Gaming\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nMaster the basics of 
 American Mahjong! This series covers tile identification\, reading the Nat
 ional Mah Jongg League card\, and fundamental game strategies in a friendl
