DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Children\, Tweens\n\nTo ensure fair access for as man
 y families as possible\, please read the registration guidelines for this 
 program.One Session Per Month: Patrons may register for only one session o
 f this program per month.Duplicate Registrations: Registrations for more t
 han one session in the same month will be cancelled.We appreciate your und
 erstanding as we work to provide equitable access to this popular program.
 Calling all young adventurers ages 9 to 12! Join us for an exciting journe
 y into the world of Dungeons & Dragons\, where your imagination sets the c
 ourse. Together\, we’ll learn how to create unique characters\, navigate
  magical lands\, and solve thrilling quests. No prior experience is needed
 —new and experienced players alike are welcome!In each session\, you'll 
 explore stories full of mystery\, monsters\, and more all while working as
  a team to overcome challenges and puzzles. Whether you're a brave warrior
 \, a clever wizard\, or a sneaky rogue\, there’s always an adventure wai
 ting. Are you ready to roll the dice and discover where the story leads?Sp
 aces are limited\, so sign up today to secure your spot in our grand adven
 ture! All materials will be provided.Registration will open at 9:00AM on W
 ednesday\, October 28th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents a
 nd on Wednesday\, November 4th for residents of other municipalities.LIBRA
 RY PROGRAM POLICIES:Drop Off Program – This program is intended for chil
 dren over the age of 9 years who can participate independently. Adult(s) m
 ust be present to check in child with youth services staff prior to progra
 m. Adults will not be allowed in the event space. Designated Ages – Plea
 se adhere to the age restrictions designated on your registration. Only ch
 ildren in that age range will be admitted.Registration Requirements – To
  help us manage our space\, please register every person who will be atten
 ding\, including siblings.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their regi
 stration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted fr
 om registering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Ple
 ase cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the p
 rogram to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their chan
 ge in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior
  to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances.
  The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, yo
 ur spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted en
 try. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. Howeve
 r\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past 
 the start time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dungeons-and-dragons-adv
 enture-club-kids-ages-9-12-only-2-168867
