 h color a number 1-5 and keep record of the number assigned to the color. 
 You will need to reference this throughout the project. Ex: red - 1\, blue
  - 2\, pink - 3\, etc. - this is part of the chaos fun!Hook - based on rec
 ommended size for yard being used (H/5mm\, I/5.5MM typically works for mos
 t projects and yarn weight)Recommend worsted weight or light/sport wright 
 yarn if making for babyScissorsStitch MarkersYarn NeedleSee right hand sid
 e of screen for printable PDF of materials and more information. This proj
 ect is for experienced crocheters. Participants are also welcome to bring 
 their own project to work on.
