 r is provided\, players of all levels are welcome to learn from one anothe
 r. What to Bring: Sets and racks (at least one per four players)Your curre
 nt 2026 National Mah Jongg League cardA friendly\, patient attitude! Commu
 nity GuidelinesBe Welcoming:  We all started as beginners! Please be patie
 nt with those still learning to playThe "Rule of Five": If a fifth player 
 joins your table\, we suggest the "East Sits Out" rotation—the player in
  the East position rotates out for one hand so everyone gets to playFair P
 lay:  Tables are available on a first-come\, first-served basisPlease keep
  talk inclusive and the atmosphere kindRegistration is Required for this e
 ventThis program is for adults aged +18
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
